(area "introspection" :when "the agent needs to know what a definition takes or does: its arity, signature, doc or source")

(memory "internal/introspection/forms" :when "the agent needs a definition's arity, signature, doc or source, or must tell a function from a macro; or a call just failed on its arguments"
  "- (describe 'name) prints kind, arity, signature, doc at once.
- (apropos \"text\") documented names whose name or doc contains text. Finds form
  by what it does, not what it is called.
- (args 'name) keyword arguments as (:key \"type\" required \"description\")
lists, required t or nil.
- (arity f) (min max) for function or macro, max nil with &rest; nil if f not
  callable.
- (signature 'name) · (docstring 'name) two halves of doc as strings, nil if
  undocumented.
- (source 'name) defun or defmacro form that last defined name. Reread own code
  instead of recalling it.
- (functionp x) · (macrop x) whether x is function or macro.")
